{"resourceIdentifier":"4645","resourceName":"Wudi Lvhe Composting project","description":"Wudi Lvhe Composting project (hereinafter as “the project”) installs a set of organic fertilizersproduction lines with an annual output of 50,000 tones to treat the manure from the cattle \r\nfarms in Wudi Country, Binzhou city, Shandong Province, China. The project is owned by WudiCounty Lvhe Organic Fertilizer Co., LTD. The purpose of the project activity is to avoid methane\r\nemissions through controlled aerobic treatment by composting of manure and microbial strains.In absence of the project, all manure waste produced was left to decay in uncovered anaerobic \r\nlagoons, which is the most economic, viable and reasonable for livestock farm owners.In this project, the collected cattle manure will be utilized through a fermentation composting \r\nprocess. After the fermentation, both solids and wastewater are then treated by a fertilizer production system, of which can produce organic fertilizers used for application to lands. Without \r\nthis project, the farms in project areas remain conditions of uncovered anaerobic lagoons that may bring a larger amount of GHG emissions sent to the atmosphere.\r\nDuring the implementation of the project, it is estimated that about 165,000 tons of cattle manure would be treated and composted, with 50,000 tons of organic fertilizer generated per \r\nyear. Besides, the GHG emissions is expected to reduce 57,116 t CO2e per year and 571,160 tCO2e in a 10-year crediting period.","location":{"latitude":37.939000,"longitude":117.583995},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-09-15","endExclusive":"2023-10-16","endInclusive":"2023-10-15"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4645"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Chewang Town, Wudi County, Binzhou Shandong Provin"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Wudi County Lvhe Organic Fertilizer Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Shandong Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 18763033998"},{"type":"string","value":"Lgf3998@163.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"57075"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D.,AMS-III.F."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"27/09/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 10/03/2022 - 09/03/2032"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=97241&IDKEY=oiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfi134095339","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4645_31JUL2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-09-15T15:19:50.13Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=95608&IDKEY=klksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098q131843432","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"04-Wudi Lvhe Composting Project-Listing_Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-08-16T09:21:27.63Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=119616&IDKEY=a8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0n164950464","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"01-Wudi Lvhe-PD_VCS4645_v03-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-09-27T16:05:39.817Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org